  "title": "SRSF1 loss rewires a recurrent splice-regulator network instead of inducing SRSF2 compensation",
  "status": "grounded",
  "rejection_reason": null,
  "exact_observed_result": "Srsf1 knockdown produced uneven but FDR-supported downstream RNA-processing signatures, with Ptbp2, Rbm28, Dazap1, and Psip1 rising while related SR, hnRNP, and CLK transcripts such as Srsf2, Hnrnpdl, Clk4, and Clk1 fell.",
